WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.583 --> 00:00:02.585
“This isn’t a vacation, 
  it's a quarantine.”

00:00:02.585 --> 00:00:03.920
“We're the only 
people around here.”

00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:10.885
“Where's your mask?”

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:13.013
“This isn't a vacation,
  it's a quarantine.”

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:14.389
“A quarantine in style.”

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:21.021
“Are you kidding me?”

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:25.275
“This is incredible. Sick!” 

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:26.860
“And it’s all ours.”

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.987
“The only neighbor 
   is miles away.”

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.702
“I thought you were 
spending quarantine alone?”

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:38.038
“What are you doing here?”

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:41.207
“I wanted to see you.
And quarantine can be fun.”

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:52.469
“Miri.”

00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:53.803
“Jump in. Water’s fine.”

00:00:54.345 --> 00:00:56.139
“Who is this?”
“I don’t know.”

00:00:56.139 --> 00:00:57.682
“That's creepy, Parker.”

00:01:07.817 --> 00:01:08.943
“Who is that guy?”

00:01:26.836 --> 00:01:27.962
“Stop! Help me!”

00:01:27.962 --> 00:01:28.963
“Oh my God!”

00:01:28.963 --> 00:01:30.048
“Just one moment.”

00:01:30.965 --> 00:01:33.593
“Unlock the door!
Unlock the door!”

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:35.929
“You have a mask, 
don't you? Your mask.”

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:36.596
“What?”

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:38.306
“I can't let you in. 
It's not safe.”

00:01:38.306 --> 00:01:40.683
“Are you kidding me, lady?!
Please!”

